@startuml
title PR #18915 - sparse HCCL checkpoint updates
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Caller as C
participant "HCCL Trainer" as T
participant "RPC thread / HTTP" as R
participant "All TP/PP/DP workers" as W
participant "HCCL group" as H
participant "Loader views / ExitStack" as V
participant "vLLM checkpoint loader" as L
database "Model parameters" as M
== Shared baseline and rendezvous ==
C -> C: make_patches(checkpoint coordinates)
C -> R: pause generation
C -> T: Factory.trainer_init
T ->> R: init_weight_transfer_engine (side thread)
R -> W: init_transfer_engine
W -> W: validate config / world_size / rank
par trainer rank 0
T -> H: join stateless group
else worker ranks
W -> H: rank=1+dp_rank*(TP*PP)+local_rank
end
H --> T: rendezvous complete
T --> C: engine ready
== One-shot update ==
C -> T: send_weights(patches)
T -> T: validate / normalize device and contiguity
T -> R: start_weight_update
R -> W: guards, preserve initialized weights
T ->> R: update_weights(metadata) (side thread)
R -> W: base update_weights -> receive_weights
par trainer main thread
T -> H: broadcast int32 indices and values
else every worker
W -> H: consume all broadcasts in identical order
end
W -> W: cast indices to int64; PP filter
W -> V: enter all loader views
V -> M: shared-storage transpose view
W -> L: load_checkpoint_weight_patches
L -> L: validate, NaN staging, ordered chunks
L -> M: native load_weights / TP / EP / packed mapping
M -> M: masked final copy
L --> W: loaded
W -> V: exit in reverse order
V -> M: restore inference views
W -> W: base torch.accelerator.synchronize()
note right of W: Cross-ambient-device sync target
has not been directly tested.
W --> R: update RPC completed
R --> T: future.result completed
T -> T: synchronize sender stream
T -> R: finish_weight_update
R -> W: no-op sparse finish; close framework session
T --> C: send_weights returned
C -> T: shutdown communicator
C -> R: resume (success only)
C -> R: completions
R -> M: inference
M --> R: tokens
R --> C: HTTP response
note over V,M: Failure unwinds views, not weight values.
Keep generation paused until recovery.
@enduml
